{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2023-05-02 12:05:00', 'title': '3M ENTERS AGREEMENTS WITH PIERREL FOR THE SALE OF ASSETS ASSOCIATED WITH THE DENTAL LOCAL ANESTHETIC BUSINESS', 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN. , MAY 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3M TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO AGREEMENTS TO SELL CERTAIN ASSETS ASSOCIATED WITH ITS DENTAL LOCAL ANESTHETIC PORTFOLIO, BASED IN SEEFELD, GERMANY, TO PIERREL S.P.A.'}{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2023-05-02 07:30:00', 'title': 'THE FRESH FACTORY REPORTS FISCAL 2022 RESULTS WITH RECORD ANNUAL TOTAL BILLED REVENUE OF $20.3M', 'text': 'THE COMPANY REPORTED A RECORD FULL-YEAR BILLED REVENUE OF $20.3M ($27.8M CAD), REPRESENTING A YEAR-OVER-YEAR INCREASE OF 50.0% FROM 2021. THIS WAS THE NINTH CONSECUTIVE QUARTER OF RECORD BILLED REVENUE, TOTALING $5.9M IN Q4 2022 ($8.1M CAD), COMPARED TO $3.6M ($4.9M CAD) IN Q4 2021, REPRESENTING A YEAR-OVER-YEAR INCREASE OF 64.0%.'}